{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":205803,\"title\":\"The Making of ‘Mulholland Drive’\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A short documentary about the making of David Lynch's film Mulholland Drive.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wJeDoWlDKhhtAgsriXkRVk9N0Iw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.7,\"voteCount\":17,\"year\":2004,\"runtime\":24,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"David Hertzog Dessites\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1188201,\"name\":\"David Hertzog Dessites\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pVa1QN5SVXpHPxYMKt5pfDspnXz.jpg\"},{\"id\":5602,\"name\":\"David Lynch\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wwBzRDoIW6Ld64h6OkQ6ImCZKsR.jpg\"},{\"id\":3489,\"name\":\"Naomi Watts\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7ysvff7ZhW388SIh2YjQ0XIryOn.jpg\"},{\"id\":15007,\"name\":\"Laura Harring\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6g64N2VsADTPRDsKcJDO2ayGQUt.jpg\"},{\"id\":5628,\"name\":\"Angelo Badalamenti\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x80I3W87lIfuPn3A3smVrGSA8Bx.jpg\"},{\"id\":15009,\"name\":\"Justin Theroux\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6YuPMsLDMoD5BRkzWIjllwFFt5Y.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1412113,\"title\":\"Squid Game: Making Season 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yQGaui0bQ5Ai3KIFBB45nTeIqad.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zecxlBpLx0aLIjNjX1IOZuaSgo0.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From set designs to character arcs, get exclusive cast and director interviews on how Season 2 of the globally most-watched series was brought to life.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1610413,\"title\":\"One Last Adventure: The Making of Stranger Things 5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iX3ccl1TUNZgu4cNUm1pRLcevww.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/edGuDPKY6qHBg9hYvmnvLjcFoy4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An inside look at the years of effort and craft that went into the final installment of the Duffer Brothers' generation-defining series.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":591278,\"title\":\"Game of Thrones: The Last Watch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tVyKpOYDtKzs4SOYCbZn4YNFWHI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6hfmHRaZNKzazyDDLli5CbT6L8H.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For a year, acclaimed British filmmaker Jeanie Finlay was embedded on the set of the hit HBO series “Game of Thrones,” chronicling the creation of the show’s most ambitious and complicated season.  Debuting one week after the series 8 finale, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH delves deep into the mud and blood to reveal the tears and triumphs involved in the challenge of bringing the fantasy world of Westeros to life in the very real studios, fields and car-parks of Northern Ireland.  Made with unprecedented access, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH is an up-close and personal portrait from the trenches of production, following the crew and the cast as they contend with extreme weather, punishing deadlines and an ever-excited fandom hungry for spoilers.  Much more than a “making of” documentary, this is a funny, heartbreaking story, told with wit and intimacy, about the bittersweet pleasures of what it means to create a world – and then have to say goodbye to it.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":656663,\"title\":\"Jackass Forever\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ruHDFumJfW7F2vEqTZEQQ9xT7CA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2J8DpT5bqV0AiI9VVcfiuqKo5l.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Jackass crew, along with some newcomers, returns for one more round of hilarious, absurd, and dangerous stunts.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1015606,\"title\":\"Obi-Wan Kenobi: A Jedi's Return\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vQGgvXjoMZf8x1m3BHsMxVXPyck.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c8jqJ502BzvkCXy2enrao1PuQEE.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This special explores the return of Obi-Wan Kenobi and Anakin Skywalker to the screen, as well as Ewan McGregor and Hayden Christensen to their classic roles. Director Deborah Chow leads the cast and crew as they create new heroes and villains that live alongside new incarnations of beloved Star Wars characters, and an epic story that dramatically bridges the saga films.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1059673,\"title\":\"Avatar: The Deep Dive - A Special Edition of 20/20\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pzZGqIyrrSqIfrkPLJnN1tvCGnV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eoAvHxfbaPOcfiQyjqypWIXWxDr.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An inside look at one of the most anticipated movie sequels ever with James Cameron and cast.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1472668,\"title\":\"Wick Is Pain\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ctZ9bjmCYyfFt3cUepc9axr0zHs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fog8Vbeg1KOZAucucPxgYpXJ0a0.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Witness the never-before-seen footage and true story behind the John Wick phenomenon – from independent film to billion-dollar franchise.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":828853,\"title\":\"Jackass 4.5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bl686OSeMQOvs90IQAgt8QipCsB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/42975nYxawMHta0yoAtwm6ZPy0L.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Through outrageous, never-before-seen footage, witness the making of the Jackass crew's last go at wild stunts.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":239459,\"title\":\"No Half Measures: Creating the Final Season of Breaking Bad\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uI6dU5hbhskkgA7TQL0qq74ALjR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/27JyB13Wr2KEVUIKjtw9x669I39.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A documentary about the making of season five of the acclaimed AMC series Breaking Bad.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76180,\"title\":\"Empire of Dreams: The Story of the Star Wars Trilogy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xq0MPT1lLxfznTRaAbInxWT2wfh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/11tVJLKi2PgcuNWqaCNPSOpINQx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From the earliest versions of the script to the blockbuster debuts, explore the creation of the Star Wars Trilogy.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14543,\"title\":\"The Matrix Revisited\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fNG2JOskhQnttmAaj2knM5h59Io.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lBdXACywnLwKUZmZkZ87djDQBeV.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The film goes behind the scenes of the 1999 sci-fi movie The Matrix.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":301959,\"title\":\"Interstellar: Nolan's Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i4PpBcuLvdcJwIf3hkcV9QDR1iH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look behind the lens of Christopher Nolan's space epic.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"jbZJ487oJlY